			"notes": "#### Marked as stable.\n- The jars support 26.2 and 26.1.X for the respective jars.\n- 26.1.x support will be continued as it is supposedly the new LTS version.\n\n#### Changelog:\n- This release is a bug-fix release.\n- Fixed [durability alert animation being desynced](https://github.com/coredex-source/DetailArmorBarReconstructed/issues/43).\n- Fixed/Finished [incomplete implementation for Overflowing Bars ](https://github.com/coredex-source/DetailArmorBarReconstructed/issues/48).\n- Ported the [overflow icon fix from 1.21.1](https://github.com/coredex-source/DetailArmorBarReconstructed/issues/50).\n- Fixed [reverse armor bar being improperly reversed](https://github.com/coredex-source/DetailArmorBarReconstructed/issues/52)\n- Fixed color alpha for color picker preview in the new config.\n\n#### Technical changes:\n- Switched to a multi-loader, multi-version branch using modstich and stonecutter to ease future development and reduce the amount of branches. It currently supports versions >= 26.1.\n- Added build workflows for the latest main branch."
		},
