			"notes": "#### Completed the port to NeoForge for Minecraft 26.2.\n- The jars support 26.2.\n- 26.1.x support will be continued, and the jars will be uploaded soon.\n\n#### Gameplay/Mod Changes:\n- New config screen style.\n- Switch to EclipseUI for config screen design.\n\n#### The release is currently in beta and will receive a few more updates before being marked stable.\n#### Beta releases of the mod usually only lack UPCOMING features and are stable to use.\n#### Alpha releases of the mod might contain unwanted bugs."
		},
